{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"chenghuang-e-o116","title":"陈勤陵轹统被斫数日死","accounts":[{"id":"chenghuang-a-bed955d0e33fc51bce9b","label":"正文","text":"陈勤陵轹统被斫数日死","evidence":["chenghuang-q-9db610a445f5cfa6802a"]}],"participants":[{"person":"chenghuang-p0020","role":"督、刚勇任气、因督祭酒陵轹一坐举罚不以其道、怒詈统及其父操、乘酒凶悖又于道路辱统、被斫数日乃死","evidence":["chenghuang-q-9db610a445f5cfa6802a"]},{"person":"ling-tong","role":"疾其侮慢面折不为用、流涕不答、不忍引刀斫勤","evidence":["chenghuang-q-9db610a445f5cfa6802a"]},{"person":"sun-quan","role":"破保屯先还","evidence":["chenghuang-q-9db610a445f5cfa6802a"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["chenghuang-q-9db610a445f5cfa6802a"]},"ordering_evidence":"chenghuang-q-9db610a445f5cfa6802a","source_order":[55,269,0],"order":9888}],"persons":[{"id":"chenghuang-p0020","name":"陈勤","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"ling-tong","name":"凌统","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"sun-quan","name":"孙权","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"chenghuang-q-9db610a445f5cfa6802a","section":"chapter-055","block":"b-3fc3297fd7ab8f563a24","layer":"original","quote":"后从击山贼，权破保屯，先还。余麻屯万人，统与督张异等留，攻围之，克日当攻。先期〖5〗，统与督陈勤，会饮酒。勤刚勇任气，因督祭酒〖6〗，陵轹一坐〖7〗，举罚不以其道〖8〗。统疾其侮慢，面折不为用〖9〗。勤怒詈统，及其父操；统流涕不答，众因罢出。勤乘酒凶悖，又于道路辱统。统不忍，引刀斫勤，数日乃死","section_title":"程黄韩蒋周陈董甘凌徐潘丁传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0117.xhtml","index":268,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":147,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
